<title>USA: Kushner-Locke names Lilliston Pres, COO.</title>
<headline>Kushner-Locke names Lilliston Pres, COO.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kushner-Locke Co on Thursday named Bruce St J Lilliston to the newly-created post of president and chief operating officer, effective Oct. 1, 1996.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Lilliston will be responsible for managing the company's day-to-day activities.</p>
